<mxGraphModel><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;LaminarFlow-Backend/internal/migrate/migrate.go&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="30" width="700" x="850" y="980" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Andale Mono&quot;&gt;type … struct&lt;/font&gt; — one schema_migrations row paired with whether its file still exists&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;no NewX factory and no methods — &lt;a href=&quot;#func#Status&quot;&gt;Status&lt;/a&gt;() in runner.go is what builds every Record,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;by walking the loaded &lt;a href=&quot;#class#Migration&quot;&gt;Migration&lt;/a&gt; set against the versions already in the table&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="60" width="700" x="850" y="1010" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontFamily=Andale Mono;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;type &lt;b&gt;Record&lt;/b&gt; struct&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="30" width="700" x="850" y="1070" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="5" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontFamily=Andale Mono;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Attributes&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;+ Version: int64&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;+ Name: string&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;+ Applied: bool&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;all three are exported (+); this is a report value, never persisted itself&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Version and Name mirror the schema_migrations columns of the same name&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Applied is true when that version is already in schema_migrations, false when&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;the file is on disk but has not run yet&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#func#Status&quot;&gt;Status&lt;/a&gt;() also emits a Record for an applied version with no file left: its Name is&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;the literal &quot;(file missing)&quot; and Applied is true — a schema ahead of the files&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="220" width="700" x="850" y="1100" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel>
